dc2bb300025','inherit','open','closed','','case-1','','','2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/case-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(18,0,'2026-07-24 05:46:29','2026-07-24 05:46:29','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1702863361902-93c51bfbd923','3D printed display pieces','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1702863361902-93c51bfbd923','inherit','open','closed','','case-2','','','2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/case-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(19,0,'2026-07-24 05:46:30','2026-07-24 05:46:30','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611505908502-5b67e53e3a76','Functional part being printed','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611505908502-5b67e53e3a76','inherit','open','closed','','case-3','','','2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/case-3.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(20,0,'2026-07-24 05:46:32','2026-07-24 05:46:32','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603974739154-7b055aeec101','Open-frame 3D printer','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603974739154-7b055aeec101','inherit','open','closed','','case-4','','','2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/case-4.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(21,0,'2026-07-24 05:46:33','2026-07-24 05:46:33','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611505982706-9ebc79e5d3f1','3D printer hot end close-up','Source: Unsplash (Unsplash License: https://unsplash.com/license). Original image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611505982706-9ebc79e5d3f1','inherit','open','closed','','equipment','','','2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/equipment.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(22,1,'2026-07-24 05:48:25','2026-07-24 05:48:25','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-tokraft','','','2026-07-24 05:48:25','2026-07-24 05:48:25','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-global-styles-tokraft/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(23,1,'2026-07-24 05:48:55','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','自动草稿','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2026-07-24 05:48:55','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?p=23',0,'post','',0),(24,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','<p>Dual-nozzle production profile with a large build volume for multi-material prototypes and larger functional parts. Verify installed firmware, chamber settings and nozzle package before publishing production claims.</p><ul><li>Profile used for customer-facing capability notes</li><li>Final process settings are confirmed during file review</li><li>Not every material is available on every machine</li></ul>','Bambu Lab H2D','Dual-nozzle production&hellip;','publish','closed','closed','','bambu-lab-h2d','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/tokraft_equipment/bambu-lab-h2d/',1,'tokraft_equipment','',0),(25,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','<p>Enclosed CoreXY profile suited to engineering materials and repeatable functional parts. Useful when dimensional consistency and protected material handling matter more than open-frame flexibility.</p><ul><li>Profile used for customer-facing capability notes</li><li>Final process settings are confirmed during file review</li><li>Not every material is available on every machine</li></ul>','Bambu Lab X1 Carbon','Enclosed CoreXY profil&hellip;','publish','closed','closed','','bambu-lab-x1-carbon','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/tokraft_equipment/bambu-lab-x1-carbon/',2,'tokraft_equipment','',0),(26,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','<p>Enclosed workhorse for small-batch brackets, fixtures and everyday production parts. A practical default for PETG and ASA jobs that do not need the largest build volume.</p><ul><li>Profile used for customer-facing capability notes</li><li>Final process settings are confirmed during file review</li><li>Not every material is available on every machine</li></ul>','Bambu Lab P1S','Enclosed workhorse for&hellip;','publish','closed','closed','','bambu-lab-p1s','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/tokraft_equipment/bambu-lab-p1s/',3,'tokraft_equipment','',0),(27,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','<p>Compact profile for smaller samples, colour studies and quick iterations. Ideal when customers need a fast first look before committing to a larger production run.</p><ul><li>Profile used for customer-facing capability notes</li><li>Final process settings are confirmed during file review</li><li>Not every material is available on every machine</li></ul>','Bambu Lab A1 mini','Compact profile for sm&hellip;','publish','closed','closed','','bambu-lab-a1-mini','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/tokraft_equipment/bambu-lab-a1-mini/',4,'tokraft_equipment','',0),(28,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:10','2026-07-24 05:51:10','<p><strong>Demonstration application:</strong> This page shows the information a production-ready alignment jig should include. Replace it with a completed toKraft project and approved client photography before using it as a customer reference.</p><h2>Part requirements</h2><p>Repeatable alignment, reinforced mounting zones and clear fit notes are more useful than a highly polished rendering. PETG is often chosen when toughness and practical chemical resistance matter.</p>','Application Example - Assembly Alignment Jig','Demonstration application for a functional 3D printed part.','draft','closed','closed','','application-example-assembly-alignment-jig','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/case-studies/application-example-assembly-alignment-jig/',1,'tokraft_case_study','',0),(29,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:11','2026-07-24 05:51:11','<p><strong>Demonstration application:</strong> A small bracket is a useful way to compare material choices, mounting direction and wall thickness. The public copy should be replaced with your own verified project details before launch.</p><h2>Part requirements</h2><p>Confirm cable diameter, fastener type, mounting surface and expected load before quoting. A file review can identify overhangs or features that need support.</p>','Application Example - Cable Management Bracket','Demonstration application for a functional 3D printed part.','draft','closed','closed','','application-example-cable-management-bracket','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/case-studies/application-example-cable-management-bracket/',2,'tokraft_case_study','',0),(30,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:11','2026-07-24 05:51:11','<p><strong>Demonstration application:</strong> This example explains how display-oriented parts differ from load-bearing components. It is not presented as a completed customer order.</p><h2>Part requirements</h2><p>PLA is often suitable when visual detail, crisp edges and standard indoor conditions matter more than heat or impact resistance.</p>','Application Example - Fine Detail Display Part','Demonstration application for a functional 3D printed part.','draft','closed','closed','','application-example-fine-detail-display-part','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/case-studies/application-example-fine-detail-display-part/',3,'tokraft_case_study','',0),(31,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:11','2026-07-24 05:51:11','<p><strong>Demonstration application:</strong> Flexible parts need a different design review from rigid brackets. This is a sample content record, ready to be replaced by an approved project.</p><h2>Part requirements</h2><p>For TPU, specify the compression target, contact surface, material hardness and whether the part will be exposed to oils, heat or weather.</p>','Application Example - Flexible Protective Foot','Demonstration application for a functional 3D printed part.','draft','closed','closed','','application-example-flexible-protective-foot','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/case-studies/application-example-flexible-protective-foot/',4,'tokraft_case_study','',0),(32,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:11','2026-07-24 05:51:11','<p><strong>Demonstration application:</strong> An outdoor guide illustrates the need to specify UV exposure, fastener positions and the expected environment. This entry is not a client project claim.</p><h2>Part requirements</h2><p>ASA is commonly selected when outdoor weathering and UV resistance are important. Final wall thickness and orientation require a review of the supplied model.</p>','Application Example - Outdoor Cable Guide','Demonstration application for a functional 3D printed part.','draft','closed','closed','','application-example-outdoor-cable-guide','','','2026-07-24 15:09:15','2026-07-24 15:09:15','',0,'http://localhost:8080/case-studies/application-example-outdoor-cable-guide/',5,'tokraft_case_study','',0),(33,0,'2026-07-24 05:51:12','2026-07-24 05:51:12','','Cable Dock','Size: Single, Material: PLA, Colour: Charcoal','publish','closed','closed','','cable-dock','','','2026-07-24 05:51:12','2026-07-24 05:51:12','',12,'http://localhost:8080/?post_type=product_variation&p=33',0,'product_variation','',0),(34,0,'2026-07-24 